<title>USA: Tokheim forms alliance with Sharp.</title>
<headline>Tokheim forms alliance with Sharp.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WAYNE, Ind. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokheim Corp said Thursday it has entered a partnership with Sharp Corp to develop and market a line of petroleum systems in Japan.</p>
<p>Terms of the alliance were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Tokheim, maker of petroleum dispensing systems for the oil services market, said the two companies planned to develop dispensing products and point-of-sale systems.</p>
<p>Sharp already has been developing point-of-sale systems in Japan, using its liquid crystal display and other communication technologies, Tokheim said.</p>
<p>((-- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
